    "description": "This NCEI accession consists of surface underway ocean measurements of fugacity of carbon dioxide (fCO2), salinity, and sea surface temperature collected during the R/V Thomas G. Thompson transit cruise TN367 (EXPOCODE 325020190520)  in the South and North Atlantic Ocean from Cape Town, SA to Woods Hole, MA from 2019-05-20 to 2019-06-09. These measurements were collected with support from NOAA's Climate Program Office (CPO).",
